VPC --> Peering Connection

Name: VPC Peering from VPC-A to VPC-B
Select local VPC to peer with: Select VPC-A
Select another VPC to peer with: Select VPC-B & copy the VPC-B ID (for another region)

Accept the VPC peering connection at VPC-B(Mumbai) Peering connections

Update the Route Table of VPC-A with CIDR(20.0.0.0/16) of VPC-B & Select the Peering connection in Target.

Update the Route Table of VPC-B with CIDR of VPC-A(10.0.0.0/16) & Select the Peering connection in Target.

Now the resource can communicate privately.

